Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add watch history export endpoint

Adds GET /Users/{userId}/WatchHistory/Export which returns the played
movies and episodes of a user as CSV or JSON.

- Add WatchHistoryEntryDto
- Add WatchHistoryExporter helper with RFC 4180 escaping
- Add WatchHistoryController
